course: dictionary
lesson: 7166
title: One word, several meanings
level: primary-5
stars: 0
explain: Some words have more than one meaning, and the context tells you which one the writer means. The word periwinkle is a good example. It can name a small sea creature, a garden flower, or a colour.
explain: Look at the clues around the word. In «The Madagascar periwinkle contains chemicals used to make medicines for some childhood cancers», the words chemicals and medicines tell you it is a plant, not a snail and not a colour.
explain: Try each meaning in the sentence and see which one fits. A snail cannot make medicines, and a colour cannot contain chemicals, so the plant meaning is the only one that makes sense here.
fact: A word with more than one meaning is called a multiple-meaning word.
fact: «Periwinkle» can mean a small sea snail with a spiral shell, found on rocks at the seashore.
fact: «Periwinkle» can also mean a low garden plant with blue or purple flowers.
fact: «Periwinkle» can also mean a soft blue-purple colour, as in «periwinkle blue».
fact: Rock pool periwinkles are small snails you might spot on a trip to the seashore.
exercise: «The periwinkles clung to the rocks in the rock pool.» What are periwinkles here? | *Small sea snails with spiral shells | Low garden plants with blue flowers | A soft blue-purple colour
exercise: «She painted her bedroom wall in a soft periwinkle.» What does periwinkle mean here? | *A soft blue-purple colour | A rock at the seashore | A small sea snail on the rocks
exercise: «The gardener planted periwinkle along the path, where its blue flowers spread over the soil.» What is periwinkle here? | A type of bird | *A low garden plant with blue or purple flowers | A sea snail with a spiral shell
test: «Mum bought a periwinkle scarf.» Which meaning fits best? | A garden plant with a spiral shell | *A colour | A small snail
test: In «Rock pool periwinkles clung to the stones», which clue tells you periwinkle means a sea creature? | The word garden | The word flowers | The word painted | *The words rock pool
exam: «The Madagascar periwinkle contains chemicals used to make medicines.» What does the sentence tell you periwinkle is? | A type of rock | A sea snail | A colour | *A plant
